# Exclude build artefacts, caches, personalised files, and sensitive information from version control.
# https://git-scm.com/docs/gitignore
# https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files

## Tooling configuration (e.g. agent harnesses and IDE settings)
#  These files often contain personalised settings and sometimes also sensitive information.
#  Keep them on your computer and add generic, shareable files to the `tools` directory instead.
.beads/
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.idea/
.junie/
.opencode/
.omo/
.run/
.vscode/
.zed/
*.local
*.local.*
*-local.*
.mcp.json

## Temporary artefacts
#  These files are automatically generated.
.vitest/
dist/*
!dist/main-gha.mjs
!dist/schema.json
node_modules/
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
